# rsync rules for the python package, rooted at packages/gbnf/python. First
# match wins, so the exclusions lead. A whitelist: anything not named here
# never reaches the agent. Adding a file to the corpus means adding a line.

# Tests are withheld unless a flag prepends the rules that include them.
- *_test.py
- /tests/

+ */

+ /.gitignore
+ /MANIFEST.in
+ /Makefile
+ /README.md
+ /pyproject.toml
+ /requirements.txt
+ /uv.lock
+ /gbnf/**.py

- *
